            "line": 901,
            "text": "theorem second_coordinate_large {Λ δ f n : ℝ}\n    (hΛ : 1 ≤ Λ) (hδ : 0 < δ) (hf : 0 < f)\n    (hsmall : 100 * Λ * f ≤ δ) (hn : δ / 2 < |n|) :\n    (6 / 5 : ℝ) ^ 2 < ((4 / Λ) * n / (Real.sqrt (2 * (4 / Λ)) * f)) ^ 2"
          }
